Date: Wed, 4 Feb 2026 19:41:22 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add torque params for KIA_CARNIVAL_HEV_4TH_GEN

Required for lateral control tuning. Uses same values as non-hybrid Carnival.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 opendbc/car/torque_data/override.toml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/opendbc/car/torque_data/override.toml b/opendbc/car/torque_data/override.toml
index 6659501d..526c1428 100644
--- a/opendbc/car/torque_data/override.toml
+++ b/opendbc/car/torque_data/override.toml
@@ -67,6 +67,7 @@ legend = ["LAT_ACCEL_FACTOR", "MAX_LAT_ACCEL_MEASURED", "FRICTION"]
 "KIA_NIRO_EV_2ND_GEN" = [2.05, 2.5, 0.14]
 "GENESIS_GV80" = [2.5, 2.5, 0.1]
 "KIA_CARNIVAL_4TH_GEN" = [1.75, 1.75, 0.15]
+"KIA_CARNIVAL_HEV_4TH_GEN" = [1.75, 1.75, 0.15]
 "GMC_ACADIA" = [1.6, 1.6, 0.2]
 "LEXUS_IS_TSS2" = [2.0, 2.0, 0.1]
 "HYUNDAI_KONA_EV_2ND_GEN" = [2.5, 2.5, 0.1]
